  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WITNESS 2019-07--2023-06 (2026-06) - WITNESS 2019-07---2023-06</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WITNESS 2019-07--2023-06 (2026-06)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser ett k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till organisationen WITNESS.

WITNESS arbetar globalt f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja marginaliserade och utsatta grupper att anv&#xe4;nda video och informations- och kommunikationsteknologi (IKT) f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka deras m&#xf6;jligheter att delta i samh&#xe4;llet, st&#xe4;rka r&#xe4;ttss&#xe4;kerheten och skydda och f&#xf6;rsvara m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.

Insatsen &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att tillse att de miljoner utsatta och marginaliserade grupper som anv&#xe4;nder video och IKT f&#xf6;r att &#xe5;stadkomma f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndring kan g&#xf6;ra detta p&#xe5; ett s&#xe4;kert, etiskt och effektivt s&#xe4;tt. Detta m&#xe5;l ska &#xe5;stadkommas genom f&#xf6;ljande planerade resultat:
1) Fattiga och marginaliserade grupper, m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare, media aktivister, journalister och jurister har st&#xe4;rkt f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga och kapacitet att anv&#xe4;nda video och IKT p&#xe5; ett s&#xe4;kert, etiskt och effektivt s&#xe4;tt f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter
2) Ekosystemet f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter p&#xe5; lokal, regional och global niv&#xe5; samt mellan gr&#xe4;sr&#xf6;tter och relevanta akt&#xf6;rer p&#xe5; systemniv&#xe5; har st&#xe4;rkts
3) Personer som anv&#xe4;nder teknologiska system och IKT f&#xf6;r MR-aktivism kan g&#xf6;ra detta p&#xe5; ett s&#xe4;kert och effektivt s&#xe4;tt.
4) WITNESS institutionella kapacitet, m&#xe5;ngfald och resiliens f&#xf6;r att kunna agera som sammankallare, facilitator, f&#xf6;rsvarare och kunskapsnav har st&#xe4;rkts, f&#xf6;r att kunna st&#xf6;dja deras strategiska vision och programm&#xe5;l.
De fyra st&#xf6;rsta givarna till WITNESS &#xe4;r Sida, Ford Foundation, Oak Foundation and MacArthur Foundation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution concerns a core support to the organisation WITNESS. 

The overall objective of the contribution is to empower marginalized and vulnerable communities worldwide using video and information and communications technology (ICT) to realize opportunities to participate in society, improve access to justice and protect and defend human rights. This overall objective should be realized through the following expected outcomes:

-Poor and marginalized communities, human rights defenders, media activists, journalists and lawyers have increased skills and capacity to use video and ICTs safely, ethically, and effectively for human rights change
-The broader human rights ecosystem is strengthened between the local, regional and international levels, as well as between grassroots and systems-level stakeholders
-At risk-users can more safely and effectively use technology systems and ICTs for human rights activism
-WITNESS institutional capacity, diversity and resilience to act as a convener, facilitator, supporter and knowledge hub is strengthened, in order to support its strategic vision and programmatic goals
The four largest donors to WITNESS are Sida, Ford Foundation, Oak Foundation and MacArthur Foundation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of the intervention is to ensure that the millions of vulnerable and marginalized communities turning to video and ICTs to create change worldwide can do so safely, ethically, and effectively.
To contribute to the overarching objective the following four expected outcomes of the intervention have been identified:1) Poor and marginalized communities, human rights defenders, media activists, journalists and lawyers have increased skills and capacity to use video and ICTs safely, ethically, and effectively for human rights change&#xa0;2) The broader human rights ecosystem is strengthened between the local, regional and international levels, as well as between grassroots and systems-level stakeholders 3) At risk-users can more safely and effectively use technology systems and ICTs for human rights activism4) WITNESS&#x2019; institutional capacity, diversity and resilience to act as a convener, facilitator, supporter and knowledge hub is strengthened, in order to support its strategic vision and programmatic goals</narrative>
  </description>
